---

---

<section
  class="h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-linear-to-b from-myColor-800 to-myColor-700"
>
  <div class="text-center space-y-8">
    <div class="md:max-w-1/2 m-auto">
      <h2
        class="text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-bold font-mono text-white"
      >
        Hi
        <span class="heading-accent-bar block h-1 mt-2 mx-auto w-16 rounded-full"></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-l md:text-xl text-myColor-100 mt-6 font-sans">
        I'm Adam, a Toronto-based (but remote-friendly) Engineering leader. I'm
        a Senior Engineer, an Engineering Manager, project planner, delivery
        lead... tl;dr: I can do what needs to be done.
      </p>
      <p class="text-l md:text-xl text-myColor-100 mt-4 font-sans">
        I'm full-stack, but frontend-focused. Do you need someone to manage a
        design system? Lead a team to deliver a complex project? Have a hard
        conversation about deadlines & capacity planning? I can help with that.
      </p>
      <p class="text-l md:text-xl text-myColor-100 mt-4 font-sans">
        I love enabling engineers to do their best, by introducing and iterating
        on processes, coaching and facilitating conversations, and especially
        using AI to keep everyone moving.
      </p>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-4xl text-myColor-100 mt-16 font-mono font-bold">
          Skills & Frameworks
        </h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mt-6">
          {[
            "JavaScript",
            "React",
            "Node.js",
            "TypeScript",
            "Git",
            "Design Systems",
            "React Testing Library",
            "Python 🐍",
            "Project Planning",
            "Linear",
            "AI Engineering",
          ].map((skill) => (
            <li>
              <span class="skill-badge">{skill}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .heading-accent-bar {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #10b981, #34d399);
  }

  .skill-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .skill-badge:hover {
    border-color: #10b981;
    color: #34d399;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
  }
</style>
